## Astra Shell build dependencies (ISO 2+)
rust
cargo
gtk4
# NOTE: gtk4-rs is a Rust *crate*, not an Arch system package.
# Querying the official repos (extra/x86_64) returns HTTP 404, and adding
# it to this file would break `pacman -Sy` with "target not found".
# cargo pulls gtk4-rs automatically via Cargo.toml during `cargo build`.
libadwaita
pkgconf
clang
meson
ninja
openssl
git

## Astra Shell runtime dependencies
cairo
pango
